# Skill run issues: {{skill}}

Problems met while running the `{{skill}}` skill (version {{version}}) on {{product}}, and how the run got past them.
This file is for the **skill owner**: it is how the skill improves. Keep it during the whole run, one entry per problem,
written when the problem happens, not at the end.

Log an entry when:
- a script fails, hangs, is very slow, or prints wrong / misleading output;
- a gate fails on something that is fine, or passes on something that is wrong;
- an instruction is unclear, contradicts another, or does not fit this code base;
- you had to work around the skill (an extra command, a manual step, a hand-made file, a skipped step);
- a generated page or template states something false for this project.

Rules: no secret values (name keys only). Name client files only where needed to explain the problem. Never patch the
installed skill to get past a problem unless the user allowed it: work around it in the workspace and describe the fix here.

Severity: High (wrong or missing output a reader would trust, or a blocked run) · Medium (noise, rework, misleading
text) · Low (cosmetic, slow but finished).

